    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9e66eec2-67f3-5365-a61d-937bee0fb75b" activityNameId="2ca72852-abee-5fa2-b077-1e34badcc432" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Light fuel oil, burned in boiler 10kW, non-modulating</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Light fuel oil, burned in boiler 10kW, non-modulating
Inventory for the operation of an old light fuel oil boiler. Data related to light fuel oil input. This dataset should be used if fuel input is known.;
UUID: b1efd382-ddd3-3cac-a826-7c2943fc92b4
Direct air emissions from combustion, waste, effluents and auxiliary electricity use, input of fuel oil.  Infrastructure is included.
Location: Assumption for operation in Switzerland.
Technology: Non-modulating boiler sold in 2000.
Time period: Statistical data for regulated emissions like NOx, particles, other figures are partly based on older literature data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data published in literature based on measurements. 
Extrapolations: Some information from other European countries has been used to determine the emission factors.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b1efd382-ddd3-3cac-a826-7c2943fc92b4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
